<h1 class="page-title">Blended Rate <em>Calculator.</em></h1>
<p class="lede">Nobody budgets at list price. Nobody prices per request either. This turns a mixed model fleet into the two numbers a budget actually needs: a blended rate, and a cost per resolved outcome.</p>

<div class="tool-container">
